    <briefdescription>
<para>Configuration type for the gocart (GOCART2G wet removal) scheme. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Tuning defaults follow GEOS-ESM/GOCART GOCART2G_Process: overall washout scale 1.0, WetRemovalUFS below-cloud tuning 1.0, radius threshold 0.05 um. The C++ process layer parses the processes/wetdep/gocart options from the runtime YAML and stages these values onto the type before each bridge call. (Note: this file is cpp-preprocessed, so comment text must never contain a C-style block-comment opener.) </para>
    </detaileddescription>
